      "description": {
        "fun": "Kyurem generates a freezing energy inside itself, and when that energy leaked out, its own body froze; its latent power is greater than even Reshiram's and Zekrom's, held back only by the cold. One legend says it crashed to earth in an icy meteor, creating the Giant Chasm; another, that it's what was left when the original dragon split in two. It waits for a hero to fill in its missing parts with truth or ideals.",
        "guide": "Kyurem is a Dragon- and Ice-type Legendary Pokémon from Unova's legends, with a body frozen by its own icy energy. Using the DNA Splicers, it can fuse with Reshiram to become White Kyurem or with Zekrom to become Black Kyurem.",
